{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_10003_01_h",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:691d1dc0fe4d2c42ec6e91e24121a70c6d5bdd32dc47969ecd2151e578a9f389",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_h:cmd-000026:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:48fc23db9741784c94e34e3cf7b5bcf4f2da5e13d6db1ac1fae9bd0fd78c6718",
      "text": "CM拍摄",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_h:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a096822090485f0dd755074c370ad8f818a917306f4707d3a2dd2994238cd913",
      "text": "“……嗯，果然不出我所料。\n那副耳环，非常适合你哦”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_h:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0cb0bdd0b5f999338dc1473073937163c8d40d815456e1225a13f77945042955",
      "text": "“这条项链，超级可爱的对吧！\n人家一见钟情了呢♪”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_h:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9e9ff11c58b644a90787e99f5041f0eb70eacdb29b8b7fdd0bc398b5d93c872d",
      "text": "“我是想着你才挑选的。\n愿意收下它吗？”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_h:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cc173a17acc9858dc1c9c5e270d0ae0f76ec26b42e164141b0ad5cf65212afea",
      "text": "“珠宝饰品真是奇妙呢。\n光是佩戴在身上，心情就会变得明朗起来”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_h:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:41cd8b7f8682cc7e2e67a15f690cb93fafb750b7f598af6037a750a160962637",
      "text": "“从吾之恩人处承蒙赐予的，漆黑宝石……\n对吾而言，乃不可或缺之物”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_h:cmd-000106:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f2ad0dae873faf44f08bb64b8981989103aaebc4f12db3e506fd73ad650aab8",
      "text": "“戴上珠宝，世界便熠熠生辉”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_h:cmd-000122:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f86228ce046efb1331eea823805c4ed5531c0cf5e34e195b3844d055670eeba1",
      "text": "“只属于你的珠宝，就在这里。”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_h:cmd-000134:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:39e365c2e18e3a90b52b8500406c562c4958d6db3c339cffb3bc19ecb914e58b",
      "text": "“无论何时，都将这份点亮人生的\n最棒的礼物，赠予你”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_h:cmd-000136:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0830213395790ab6ea0d21990855f41c1352323dbe801092f1c9dc7c7d1c995",
      "text": "（通过了……！导演和设计师\n都非常满意地点头了呢！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_h:cmd-000155:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:706a6de3060934c8220c81979f3f81ca870c0a9121afbb2176e726f8de6d480e",
      "text": "（吾之灵魂正在震颤。\n感受到了魔力的高涨……！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_h:cmd-000167:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:08c46249358464f5e8d6ea78cec1bd3a0a43af2cab9709dd3433431cd8ef2076",
      "text": "迷途羔羊啊，戴上这漆黑的光芒吧！\n若如此，吾便赐予汝黑暗之力！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
